    <!-- Privacy Policy -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy &amp; Data Safety</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">Shetkari Mitra respects and protects your privacy.\n\n1. Location Data: Used solely to show nearby hospitals, navigate to medical care, and assist emergency rescuers in your vicinity. Your location is processed locally and not stored or shared for advertising.\n\n2. Emergency Contacts: Stored securely on your device SQLite database for fast emergency SMS/call dispatch. No contact information is sold or transmitted to third parties.\n\n3. Camera &amp; Photos: Used only when you choose to identify a snake species or share details with verified rescuers.\n\n4. Zero Tracking: Shetkari Mitra is non-profit and contains no third-party trackers or ads.</string>
